      "level": 2,
      "text": "2. MEASURE RESISTANCE OF ECU"
    },
    {
      "type": "caution",
      "text": "CAUTION:\n1. Do not touch the ECU terminals.\n2. The tester probe should be inserted into wiring connector from wiring side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Check the resistance between each terminal of the wiring connector."
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "Remove the glove box.",
        "Unplug the wiring connectors from the ECU.",
        "Measure the resistance between each terminal of the wiring connectors."
      ]
    },
